    "postId": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "↵如果你发现你的笔记本电脑在某个区域有 WiFi 连接，但在某些 WiFi 信号满格的区域失去连接，你可能连接到了故障的 WiFi 路由器。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "办公室中有许多路由器共享相同的 SSID，以便你的笔记本电脑决定连接到最佳的 WiFi 路由器。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然而，有些可能会随着时间而故障。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果你连接到附近的故障 WiFi 路由器，允许你连接但没有适当的互联网连接，以下步骤可能会有所帮助。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "首先，使用以下命令检查你连接到哪个 WiFi 路由器：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "<pre>$ netsh wlan show interface</pre>",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "查看 SSID 下的 BSSID。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "SSID 是一个可以代表多个 WiFi 路由器的 ID，但 BSSID 是特定 WiFi 路由器的唯一 ID：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "<pre>There is 1 interface on the system:",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Name : Wireless Network Connection↵ Description : Intel(R) Centrino(R) Advanced-N 6205↵ GUID : d827d652-b7f5-412e-xxxx-1235ea895d99↵ Physical address : aa:aa:aa:aa:aa:aa↵ State : connected↵ SSID : ABC↵ BSSID : zz:zz:zz:zz:zz:zz↵ Network type : Infrastructure↵ Radio type : 802.11n↵ Authentication : WPA2-Personal↵ Cipher : CCMP↵ Connection mode : Auto Connect↵ Channel : 1↵ Receive rate (Mbps) : 144↵ Transmit rate (Mbps) : 144↵ Signal : 99%↵ Profile : ABC",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Hosted network status : Not started↵</pre>",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "笔记本电脑通过路由器 zz:zz:zz:zz:zz:zz 连接到 WiFi 网络 ABC。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在 SSID ABC 下还有其他可用的路由器吗？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "<pre>$ netsh wlan show all</pre>",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "从结果中寻找 SHOW NETWORK MODE=BSSID。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "它显示 WiFi 网络 ABC 可用的所有路由器：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "<pre>=======================================================================↵======================= SHOW NETWORKS MODE=BSSID ======================↵=======================================================================",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "SSID 8 : ABC↵ Network type : Infrastructure↵ Authentication : WPA2-Personal↵ Encryption : CCMP↵ BSSID 1 : xx:xx:xx:xx:xx:xx↵ Signal : 80%↵ Radio type : 802.11n↵ Channel : 40↵ Basic rates (Mbps) : 6 12 24↵ Other rates (Mbps) : 9 18 36 48 54↵ BSSID 2 : yy:yy:yy:yy:yy:yy↵ Signal : 76%↵ Radio type : 802.11n↵ Channel : 161↵ Basic rates (Mbps) : 6 12 24↵ Other rates (Mbps) : 9 18 36 48 54↵ BSSID 3 : zz:zz:zz:zz:zz:zz↵ Signal : 99%↵ Radio type : 802.11n↵ Channel : 11↵ Basic rates (Mbps) : 6.5 16 19.5 117↵ Other rates (Mbps) : 18 19.5 24 36 39 48 54 156↵</pre>",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "SSID ABC 下有 3 个 BSSID，这意味着当你尝试连接到名为 ABC 的 WiFi 网络时，范围内有 3 个 WiFi 路由器。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "默认情况下，使用信号最强的 WiFi 路由器，因为它可以提供最佳的连接和传输速度。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然而，在这种情况下，信号最强的路由器没有正确配置。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我们如何强制笔记本电脑连接到正常运作的路由器，即使信号较弱？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "假设我们想连接到 BSSID 为 xx:xx:xx:xx:xx:xx 的路由器。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "* *",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在 Windows 中，我们可以进入控制面板并管理你的 WiFi 设置。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "右键点击你想连接的 WiFi 网络，然后选择属性。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在无线网络属性中，勾选_启用 Intel 连接设置_，然后点击配置。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "选择_强制访问点_，输入你想连接的 BSSID。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "点击确定以保存设置。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "由于信号强度差导致连接不佳，速度可能会较慢，但至少你可以生存下来，直到有人修复问题。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "上述选项仅适用于 Intel WiFi 适配器。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我不知道其他 WiFi 驱动程序是否提供强制 BSSID 的功能。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果你在其他 WiFi 驱动程序中找到它，请告诉我。↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企业网络生存指南 - 如何连接到具有相同 SSID 的另一个 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    }
